867706aa352729bd5367c258d4fd42de7cfd19a1.
Those modules are Copyright (c) 2026 sjmotew and remain under the MIT License.
See src/narwal_skill/vendor/NOTICE.

The upstream control client is not included. This product re-implements a small
set of control payloads (pause, resume, stop, dock, and the clean/start_clean
CleanTask) from the same pinned upstream commit for its opt-in control mode.
Read-only remains the default; a permanent deny list blocks reboot, shutdown,
camera, developer, live parameter mutation, dock maintenance, task/cancel,
clean/plan/start, clean/easy_clean/start, and raw command injection.

Coordinate policy "grid" follows the raw-minus-origin placement described for
the earlier sytchi map client (referenced commit f527b72). That tree was not
present in this build, and no sytchi source was copied.
